<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Daimler-Benz started buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Daimler-Benz started buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan Securities started coverage of Daimler-Benz AG on Friday with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The company stock rose 1/8 to 54-1/8 in early trading on the New York Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Nick Snee cited stronger fundamentals for Daimler-Bens, the improvement in the dollar and a change in management in a research report.</p>
</text>
